      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَصِبٌ</span></b>  [<i>Pebbly</i>]. You say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ حَصِبَةٌ</span> and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْصَبَةٌ</span></b>  (T, S, A, K) <i>A land containing,</i> (T, S,)
or <i>abounding with,</i> (A, K,) <i>pebbles.</i> (T, S, A, K.)
And ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكَانٌ حَاصِبٌ</span></b>  <i>A place containing pebbles.</i>
(TA.) ― 
